WEBVTT

00:08.862 --> 00:10.758
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.862 --> 00:12.517
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.620 --> 00:14.034
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:14.137 --> 00:15.793
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.896 --> 00:19.000
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:19.103 --> 00:21.068
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.172 --> 00:23.172
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:23.275 --> 00:25.103
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.206 --> 00:26.724
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.827 --> 00:29.103
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:29.206 --> 00:30.689
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.793 --> 00:33.068
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.172 --> 00:35.068
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.172 --> 00:37.068
all: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有人：♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:37.172 --> 00:38.965
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.068 --> 00:40.965
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:41.068 --> 00:41.620
- ♪ SPONGEBOB
- ♪ 海绵宝宝

00:41.724 --> 00:44.448
♪ SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 方裤！

00:44.551 --> 00:46.000
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.103 --> 00:49.103
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:49.206 --> 00:50.000
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.172 --> 00:56.275
[upbeat spy music]
[欢快的间谍音乐]

00:56.379 --> 01:02.413
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:04.310 --> 01:06.482
- SALUTATIONS, HEROIC DEVOTEES.
- 致敬，英雄奉献者。

01:06.586 --> 01:09.206
I HOPE YOU'RE SECURELY SEATED
我希望你已经坐稳了

01:09.310 --> 01:10.586
AND SUFFICIENTLY HYDRATED,
并且水分充足，

01:10.689 --> 01:12.206
BECAUSE, COMING UP NEXT,
因为，接下来，

01:12.310 --> 01:15.655
IT'S THE MERMAIDMAN
& BARNACLEBOYMARATHON.
这是美人鱼
＆藤壶男孩马拉松。

01:15.758 --> 01:17.965
- WE GOT TO MAKE SURE
WE HAVE THE NECESSARY SUPPLIES
- 我们必须确定
我们有必要的物资

01:18.068 --> 01:18.965
FOR THIS MARATHON.
为了这次马拉松。

01:19.068 --> 01:20.137
- LET'S DO THIS.
- 让我们开始吧。

01:20.241 --> 01:22.000
- OKAY, HOW ARE WE ON SNACK?
- 好吧，我们吃零食怎么样？

01:22.103 --> 01:24.379
- OH, HMM,
I DON'T KNOW.
- 哦，嗯，
我不知道。

01:24.482 --> 01:27.034
WE MIGHT BE ABLE
TO PULL THROUGH...
我们也许能够
渡过难关...

01:27.137 --> 01:28.517
THE FIRST HOUR.
第一个小时。

01:28.620 --> 01:31.068
- CHECK. MERMAIDMAN
& BARNACLEBOYACTION FIGURES?
- 查看。美人鱼
& Barncleboy 动作人物？

01:31.172 --> 01:32.482
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:32.586 --> 01:33.931
CHECK.
DRAPES?
查看。
窗帘？

01:34.034 --> 01:35.000
- CHECK.
- 查看。

01:35.103 --> 01:36.931
- LAMPSHADE?
- CHECK.
- 灯罩？
- 查看。

01:37.034 --> 01:37.931
- THERMOMETER?
- 温度计？

01:38.034 --> 01:39.275
CHECK.
查看。

01:39.379 --> 01:40.620
UKULELE,
THROW PILLOW,
尤克里里琴，
抱枕，

01:40.724 --> 01:42.620
SCREENSAVER, INCENSE,
SNAIL COZY, HEADGEAR?
屏保、香、
蜗牛舒适，头饰？

01:42.724 --> 01:43.965
- CHECK.
- 查看。

01:44.068 --> 01:45.896
- AND...
[beeping]
- 并且...
[嘟嘟声]

01:46.000 --> 01:48.310
- IT'S TIME.
IT'S TIME.
- 是时候了。
是时候了。

01:48.413 --> 01:51.310
IT'S TIME TO FIGHT...
[groans]
是时候战斗了...
[呻吟]

01:51.413 --> 01:52.793
- IT'S TIME, PATRICK!
- 是时候了，帕特里克！

01:52.896 --> 01:55.103
I HOPE WE CAN MAKE DO
WITH THE FEW PROVISIONS WE HAVE.
我希望我们能做到
我们拥有的物资很少。

01:55.206 --> 01:57.931
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

01:58.034 --> 02:00.000
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

02:00.103 --> 02:01.517
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

02:01.620 --> 02:03.103
[yelling]
[大喊]

02:03.206 --> 02:05.965
- [screams]
- [laughs wickedly]
- [尖叫]
- [邪恶地笑]

02:06.068 --> 02:07.586
- FOR 60-SOME-ODD YEARS,
- 60多年来，

02:07.689 --> 02:10.310
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY
HAVE QUADRUPLE-HANDEDLY
美人鱼与藤壶男孩
拥有四手联手

02:10.413 --> 02:12.000
KEPT THE SEA CRIME-FREE.
保持海上无犯罪。

02:12.103 --> 02:15.137
AND IN CELEBRATION
OF SUCH LONGEVITY,
庆祝活动
如此长寿，

02:15.241 --> 02:17.482
WE'RE KICKING OFF
THIS WEEKEND-LONG HERO FEST
我们正在开始
这个周末的英雄盛宴

02:17.586 --> 02:21.758
WITH THE NEVER-BEFORE-AIRED
MERMAIDMAN & BARNACLEBOY
与从未播出过的
美人鱼与藤壶男孩

02:21.862 --> 02:22.965
ORIGIN SPECIAL.
起源特别。

02:23.068 --> 02:25.172
AND NOW
WITHOUT FURTHER FANFARE...
现在
没有进一步的宣传......

02:25.275 --> 02:26.724
[fanfare]
[大张旗鼓]

02:26.827 --> 02:30.862
THE MERMAIDMAN & BARNACLEBOY
ORIGIN SPE...
美人鱼与藤壶男孩
原产地规格...

02:30.965 --> 02:32.827
- NO.
[mechanical sounds]
- 不。
[机械声]

02:32.931 --> 02:37.724
[glass smashes]
NO!
[玻璃碎裂]
不！

02:37.827 --> 02:40.310
NOOOO!
不！

02:40.413 --> 02:41.793
THIS IS TERRIBLE.
这太可怕了。

02:41.896 --> 02:45.137
HOW WILL WE SEE
THE ORIGIN SPECIALNOW?
我们将如何看到
现在特别的起源？

02:45.241 --> 02:48.137
[crash]
[碰撞]

02:48.241 --> 02:49.827
- SQUIDWARD! SQUIDWARD!
- LET US IN!
- 章鱼哥！章鱼哥！
- 让我们进去！

02:49.931 --> 02:51.620
- WE'RE MISSING
THE MERMAIDMANMARATHON!
- 我们失踪了
美人鱼马拉松！

02:51.724 --> 02:53.172
- GO AWAY!
- 离开！

02:53.275 --> 02:55.000
I'VE GOT BETTER THINGS TO DO
我有更好的事情要做

02:55.103 --> 02:57.103
THAN TO WATCH GROWN MEN
PRANCE AROUND
而不是观看成年男子
腾跃

02:57.206 --> 02:58.310
IN RIDICULOUS OUTFITS.
穿着可笑的服装。

02:58.413 --> 03:02.586
[classical music]
[古典音乐]

03:02.689 --> 03:03.965
WHAT?
什么？

03:04.068 --> 03:05.241
CIRCUIT MUST HAVE BLOWN AGAIN.
电路一定又烧断了。

03:05.344 --> 03:06.965
[exclaims]
[惊呼]

03:10.551 --> 03:12.241
- HEY, THANKS FOR LETTING US IN,
SQUIDWARD.
- 嘿，谢谢你让我们进来，
章鱼哥。

03:12.344 --> 03:13.413
- YEAH, WE OWE YOU ONE.
- 是的，我们欠你一个。

03:15.482 --> 03:17.275
WHAT NOW, SPONGEBOB?
现在怎么办，海绵宝宝？

03:17.379 --> 03:18.620
- I DON'T KNOW, PATRICK.
- 我不知道，帕特里克。

03:18.724 --> 03:21.068
ALL THE TVs IN BIKINI BOTTOM
ARE KNOCKED OUT.
所有电视都在比基尼底部
被淘汰了。

03:21.172 --> 03:22.620
WE HAVE TO FIND
A SECURE PLACE,
我们必须找到
一个安全的地方，

03:22.724 --> 03:24.896
SOME PLACE THAT CAN SURVIVE
THIS WHIRLWIND.
一些可以生存的地方
这旋风。

03:25.000 --> 03:26.241
HEY, THAT'S IT.
嘿，就是这样。

03:26.344 --> 03:27.448
IF WE WANT TO SEE
如果我们想看

03:27.551 --> 03:29.310
MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY'S ORIGIN,
美人鱼
以及藤壶男孩的起源，

03:29.413 --> 03:30.310
WE'LL JUST GO TO THE SOURCE.
我们直接去找源头。

03:30.413 --> 03:32.310
FOLLOW ME, PATRICK.
跟我来，帕特里克。

03:32.413 --> 03:34.655
- THANKS FOR NOTHING,
SQUIDWARD.
- 没什么感谢的，
章鱼哥。

03:34.758 --> 03:38.103
- SO SORRY TO HAVE PUT
SUCH A WRINKLE IN YOUR PLANS.
- 很抱歉已经放了
你的计划如此糟糕。

03:38.206 --> 03:40.689
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:40.793 --> 03:44.551
both: [grunting]
两人：[咕哝]

03:44.655 --> 03:45.827
- WE MADE IT.
- 我们做到了。

03:45.931 --> 03:47.275
PATRICK, GET UP.
帕特里克，站起来。

03:47.379 --> 03:50.379
WE HAVE FOUND
THE MERMALAIR.
我们发现
梅马艾尔。

03:50.482 --> 03:53.137
both: [screaming]
两人：[尖叫]

03:53.241 --> 03:53.551
[exclamations]
[感叹]

03:53.655 --> 03:57.103
[thud]
[砰]

03:57.206 --> 03:59.206
AGAIN!
再次！

03:59.310 --> 04:01.068
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，男孩。

04:01.172 --> 04:03.275
[laughter]
[笑声]

04:05.689 --> 04:07.379
both: AGAIN!
两人：再来一次！

04:07.482 --> 04:08.965
- DO YOU MIND TELLING US
- 您介意告诉我们吗

04:09.068 --> 04:10.068
WHAT YOU'RE DOING HERE?
你在这里做什么？

04:10.172 --> 04:11.655
- WE WANT TO WATCH YOUR TV.
- 我们想看你的电视。

04:11.758 --> 04:13.310
- I HATE TO BREAK IT TO YOU,
KIDS,
- 我不想把它告诉你，
孩子们，

04:13.413 --> 04:15.241
BUT YOU'LL HAVE TO GO
SOMEWHERE ELSE.
但你必须离开
其他地方。

04:15.344 --> 04:17.724
OUR POWER GOT KNOCKED OUT
IN THE STORM.
我们的电源被切断了
在风暴中。

04:17.827 --> 04:20.655
- BUT--BUT...
NOW HOW WILL WE EVER LEARN
-但是-但是...
现在我们将如何学习

04:20.758 --> 04:22.517
ABOUT THEIR SECRET "GORININ"?
关于他们的秘密“GORININ”？

04:22.620 --> 04:24.448
- HANG ON A MINUTE, PATRICK.
- 等一下，帕特里克。

04:24.551 --> 04:25.379
WE'VE GOT MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY STANDING
我们有美人鱼
和藤壶男孩站着

04:25.482 --> 04:27.206
RIGHT OVER HERE.
就在这里。

04:27.310 --> 04:28.827
- YEAH, SO?
- 是啊，那么？

04:28.931 --> 04:29.620
- SO IF WE WANT TO HEAR
THEIR ORIGIN,
- 如果我们想听的话
他们的起源，

04:29.724 --> 04:31.931
WHY DON'T WE JUST ASK THEM?
我们为什么不直接问他们呢？

04:32.034 --> 04:32.965
- WHOA!
- 哇！

04:33.068 --> 04:35.241
YOU'RE LIKE A BRAIN PROFESSOR.
您就像一位大脑教授。

04:35.344 --> 04:37.137
- MERMAIDMAN,
BARNACLEBOY,
- 美人鱼，
藤壶男孩，

04:37.241 --> 04:39.000
WE WANT TO KNOW
HOW THIS ALL STARTED.
我们想知道
这一切是如何开始的。

04:39.103 --> 04:41.413
- YOU WANT TO GO BACK
TO THE START OF IT ALL, EH?
- 你想回去
从这一切的开始，呃？

04:41.517 --> 04:45.620
WELL, YOU SEE, IN THE BEGINNING,
IT WAS ALL DARK.
嗯，你看，一开始，
天黑了。

04:45.724 --> 04:49.793
AND THEN ALL OF A SUDDEN
AN EVENT CALLED THE BIG SPLASH
然后突然之间
名为“大水花”的活动

04:49.896 --> 04:51.344
FORMED THE SEAS--
形成海洋——

04:51.448 --> 04:54.724
- NOT THE BEGINNING OF TIME,
MERMAIDBRAIN.
- 不是时间的开始，
美人鱼大脑。

04:54.827 --> 04:58.655
THEY WANT TO KNOW HOW WE BECAME
A CRIME-FIGHTING DUO.
他们想知道我们是如何成为的
打击犯罪二人组。

04:58.758 --> 05:00.275
- OH.
RIGHT.
- 哦。
正确的。

05:00.379 --> 05:01.482
HMM.
唔。

05:01.586 --> 05:02.931
WELL, IT ALL STARTED
好吧，一切都开始了

05:03.034 --> 05:06.068
WHEN I WAS JUST A YOUNG,
HANDSOME, MUSCULAR LAD.
当我还年轻的时候，
英俊、肌肉发达的小伙子。

05:09.034 --> 05:12.379
WHEN SUDDENLY I NOTICED THAT
MY WASHING MACHINE HAD STOPPED.
当我突然注意到
我的洗衣机停止了。

05:19.413 --> 05:22.344
- WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?
- HUH?
- 你在说什么？
- 嗯？

05:22.448 --> 05:24.413
- YOU'RE SUPPOSED
TO BE TELLING THE STORY
- 你应该
讲故事

05:24.517 --> 05:26.482
OF HOW WE BECAME SUPERHEROES.
我们如何成为超级英雄。

05:26.586 --> 05:28.862
- THE STORY.
YES.
- 故事。
是的。

05:28.965 --> 05:32.344
I WAS A YOUNG, HANDSOME,
MUSCULAR LAD
我年轻、英俊、
肌肉小伙子

05:32.448 --> 05:34.379
SOAKING UP THE SUN'S RAYS
ON THE BEACH
沐浴阳光
在海滩上

05:34.482 --> 05:37.068
WHEN SUDDENLY I BECAME DROWSY.
突然我变得昏昏欲睡。

05:37.172 --> 05:38.482
[snores]
[打鼾]

05:38.586 --> 05:40.827
A WAVE CAME ASHORE
海浪冲上岸

05:40.931 --> 05:43.931
AND DREW ME
BACK INTO THE OCEAN.
并吸引了我
回到海洋。

05:44.034 --> 05:45.000
[choking]
[窒息]

05:45.103 --> 05:46.241
HELP!
帮助！

05:46.344 --> 05:48.379
HELP!
帮助！

05:48.482 --> 05:50.344
SUDDENLY I REALIZED
突然我意识到

05:50.448 --> 05:54.793
I WAS BEING SUCKED UNDER
BY A VIOLENT WHIRLPOOL.
我被吸进去了
猛烈的漩涡。

05:54.896 --> 05:57.379
I WAS RUNNING OUT
OF OXYGEN FAST.
我快没了
快速氧气。

05:57.482 --> 05:58.551
BUT BEFORE I DROWNED,
但在我淹死之前，

05:58.655 --> 06:01.758
I WAS RESCUED BY MERMAIDS.
我被美人鱼救了。

06:01.862 --> 06:03.758
THEY TOOK ME
TO THE OCEAN FLOOR
他们带走了我
到海底

06:03.862 --> 06:06.758
WHERE THEY GAVE ME
A MAGIC SEA STAR
他们给我的地方
神奇的海星

06:06.862 --> 06:09.379
THAT ALLOWED ME
TO BREATHE UNDERWATER.
这让我
在水下呼吸。

06:09.482 --> 06:12.137
[inhales]
[吸气]

06:12.241 --> 06:13.379
[exhales]
[呼气]

06:13.482 --> 06:15.482
[snores]
[打鼾]

06:15.586 --> 06:19.103
[continues snoring]
[继续打鼾]

06:19.206 --> 06:20.758
- WAKE UP, YOU OLD COOT.
- 醒醒吧，你这个老笨蛋。

06:20.862 --> 06:22.931
- HUH?
- FINISH THE STORY.
- 嗯？
- 完成故事。

06:23.034 --> 06:24.758
- YEAH, MERMAIDMAN,
WHAT ABOUT BARNACLEBOY?
- 是啊，美人鱼，
藤壶男孩呢？

06:24.862 --> 06:26.586
- YEAH.
HOW'D YOU TWO MEET?
- 是的。
你们两个是怎么认识的？

06:26.689 --> 06:28.793
- OOH.
SORRY, BOYS.
-哦。
对不起，孩子们。

06:28.896 --> 06:31.068
THERE I WAS
IN THE OCEAN,
我就在那里
在海洋中，

06:31.172 --> 06:34.931
THE ONLY HUMAN
WHO COULD BREATHE UNDERWATER.
唯一的人类
谁可以在水下呼吸。

06:35.034 --> 06:38.448
ALAS, SUCH A LIFE
GOT LONELY REAL FAST.
唉，这样的生活
很快就感到孤独。

06:38.551 --> 06:40.586
I HAD NO OTHER HUMANS
TO TALK TO.
我没有其他人
交谈。

06:40.689 --> 06:43.517
WHAT WAS A MAN TO DO?
男人该做什么？

06:43.620 --> 06:45.137
THEN MY QUESTION WAS ANSWERED.
[crash]
然后我的问题得到了解答。
[碰撞]

06:49.965 --> 06:52.241
- HEY, BARNACLEBOY,
MAKE SURE YOU SCRAPE
- 嘿，藤壶男孩，
确保刮擦

06:52.344 --> 06:53.896
THE BARNACLES UNDERNEATH TOO.
下面还有藤壶。

06:54.000 --> 06:55.206
- AYE-AYE.
- 是啊。

06:55.310 --> 06:57.827
[inhales]
[吸气]

06:59.551 --> 07:00.655
- A BOY IN TROUBLE.
- 一个陷入困境的男孩。

07:00.758 --> 07:06.413
I GOT TO ACT FAST,
OR HE'LL DROWN.
我必须快速行动，
否则他会淹死的。

07:06.517 --> 07:07.551
FEAR NOT, YOUNG MAN.
别害怕，年轻人。

07:07.655 --> 07:09.551
I'LL TAKE CARE OF THIS.
我会处理这件事。

07:09.655 --> 07:13.034
I USED MY NEW TELEKINETIC POWERS
TO DRAW BARNACLES
我使用了新的心灵感应能力
画藤壶

07:13.137 --> 07:16.068
INTO BARNACLEBOY'S BODY
WHERE THEY TOOK THE PLACE
进入藤壶男孩的身体
他们在哪里

07:16.172 --> 07:19.517
OF HIS LUNGS SO HE COULD BREATHE
UNDERWATER TOO.
他的肺部因此可以呼吸
水下也是如此。

07:19.620 --> 07:22.172
- [exhales]
- [呼气]

07:22.275 --> 07:26.000
- IT WAS AT THAT MOMENT
WE DECIDED TO TEAM UP.
- 就在那时
我们决定组队。

07:26.103 --> 07:29.310
- OH, SO THAT'S HOW YOU GUYS
GOT TOGETHER.
- 哦，你们就是这样的
在一起了。

07:29.413 --> 07:32.620
- NO, NO, NO,
THE REASON I TEAMED UP
- 不，不，不，
我组队的原因

07:32.724 --> 07:35.655
WITH THIS JOKER
IS BECAUSE I WAS STUCK
与这个小丑
是因为我被困住了

07:35.758 --> 07:38.068
BREATHING UNDERWATER
FOR THE REST OF MY LIFE.
水下呼吸
在我的余生中。

07:38.172 --> 07:39.586
- OH.
YEAH.
- 哦。
是的。

07:39.689 --> 07:42.241
- ANYWAY,
FROM THAT DAY FORWARD,
- 无论如何，
从那天起，

07:42.344 --> 07:43.413
WE BECAME...
我们成为...

07:43.517 --> 07:45.655
- MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY!
- 美人鱼和藤壶男孩！

07:45.758 --> 07:47.862
SUPERHERO CRIME FIGHTERS!
超级英雄犯罪斗士！

07:47.965 --> 07:50.137
[people shouting;
alarm clanging]
[人们大喊；
警报叮当作响]

07:50.241 --> 07:52.517
both: A CRIME IN PROGRESS.
两者：犯罪正在进行中。

07:52.620 --> 07:55.206
- [laughs wickedly]
- [邪恶地笑]

07:55.310 --> 07:56.310
- STOP!
THIEF!
- 停止！
贼！

07:56.413 --> 07:57.724
- [laughs wickedly]
- [邪恶地笑]

07:57.827 --> 08:00.965
- SEE IF YOU THINK
THIS IS FUNNY, EVILDOER.
- 看看你是否认为
这很有趣，恶人。

08:03.724 --> 08:05.241
- [laughs wickedly]
- [邪恶地笑]

08:07.000 --> 08:07.965
[chirping]
[叽叽喳喳]

08:08.068 --> 08:10.310
- WHO'S LAUGHING NOW,
THIEVING SCUM?
- 谁现在在笑，
偷窃渣滓？

08:10.413 --> 08:11.310
- THANK YOU, SIR.
- 谢谢您，先生。

08:11.413 --> 08:12.448
AND TO WHOM DO I OWE
我欠谁的债

08:12.551 --> 08:13.655
THIS DEBT OF GRATITUDE?
这种感激之情？

08:13.758 --> 08:17.551
- YOU CAN THANK ME,
MERMAIDMAN.
- 你可以感谢我，
美人鱼。

08:17.655 --> 08:19.379
- [laughs wickedly]
- [邪恶地笑]

08:19.482 --> 08:21.103
YOU'RE MINE.
你是我的。

08:22.137 --> 08:23.517
[groans]
[呻吟]

08:23.620 --> 08:25.137
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

08:25.241 --> 08:27.965
- HOW'D YOU LIKE TO TASTE
MY TENTACLE ZAPPER,
- 您想尝尝什么
我的触手电击器，

08:28.068 --> 08:29.655
MAN RAY?
曼·雷？

08:29.758 --> 08:31.310
- HELLO.
- [speaks indistinctly]
- 你好。
- [说话含糊不清]

08:31.413 --> 08:32.931
- SO WHAT ARE YOU WEARING?
- 那你穿什么？

08:33.034 --> 08:34.689
- [speaks indistinctly]
- OH.
- [说话含糊不清]
- 哦。

08:34.793 --> 08:37.344
IN THAT CASE, CAN I GET
A LARGE PEPPERONI PIZZA,
在那种情况下，我可以得到
一大份意大利辣香肠披萨，

08:37.448 --> 08:38.344
EXTRA CHEESE?
额外的奶酪？

08:38.448 --> 08:40.448
THANKS.
谢谢。

08:40.551 --> 08:41.551
THAT DIDN'T HAPPEN.
但那并没有发生。

08:41.655 --> 08:43.586
- OH, YES, IT DID.
- 哦，是的，确实如此。

08:43.689 --> 08:45.586
- OH, NO, IT DIDN'T.
- HA HA, OH, LOT YOU REMEMBER.
- 哦，不，没有。
- 哈哈，哦，你还记得很多。

08:45.689 --> 08:46.862
YOU DON'T EVEN REMEMBER
WHERE YOU LIVE.
你甚至不记得
您居住的地方。

08:46.965 --> 08:48.379
- IT DIDN'T HAPPEN.
- AND NOW
- 它没有发生。
- 现在

08:48.482 --> 08:51.965
WITHOUT ANY FURTHER DELAYS,
THE MERMAIDMAN & BARNACLEBOY
不再有任何延误，
美人鱼与藤壶男孩

08:52.068 --> 08:53.655
ORIGIN EPISODE.
起源剧集。

08:53.758 --> 08:55.068
- OH, THIS IS IT!
- 哦，就是这样！

08:55.172 --> 08:57.551
- THE STORY OF MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY
- 美人鱼的故事
和藤壶男孩

08:57.655 --> 08:58.931
ALL STARTED HERE.
一切从这里开始。

08:59.034 --> 09:00.689
- COME ON, ERNIE.
- 来吧，厄尼。

09:00.793 --> 09:02.241
THE MOVIE'S ABOUT TO START.
电影即将开始。

09:02.344 --> 09:04.275
WHERE'S THE POPCORN?
爆米花在哪里？

09:04.379 --> 09:05.931
- IT'S IN THE MICROWAVE, TIM.
- 在微波炉里，蒂姆。

09:06.034 --> 09:08.793
- AT THAT VERY MOMENT
IN THE APARTMENT DIRECTLY ABOVE,
- 就在那一刻
在正上方的公寓里，

09:08.896 --> 09:11.758
A ROGUE SCIENTIST DOING TESTS
ON RADIOACTIVE ANTS
一名流氓科学家正在做测试
关于放射性蚂蚁

09:11.862 --> 09:14.000
KNOCKS OVER A JAR
OF HIS INFECTED SPECIMENS,
打翻了一个罐子
他的感染样本，

09:14.103 --> 09:15.586
ONE OF WHICH,
WITHOUT ANY HESITATION,
其中之一，
毫不犹豫，

09:15.689 --> 09:17.586
CRAWLS DOWN ONE FLOOR
AND MIRACULOUSLY
爬下一层楼
奇迹般地

09:17.689 --> 09:19.137
LANDS UNDETECTED.
未被发现的土地。

09:19.241 --> 09:22.517
IT VICIOUSLY BITES
OUR SOON-TO-BE SUPERHERO.
它会猛烈地咬人
我们即将成为的超级英雄。

09:22.620 --> 09:23.931
HE SCREAMS IN PAIN.
他痛苦地尖叫。

09:24.034 --> 09:26.448
- AAAHHHH!
- 啊啊啊！

09:26.551 --> 09:27.758
- STUMBLING BACKWARDS...
- 跌跌撞撞地向后退去……

09:27.862 --> 09:30.034
- WHAT ON EARTH?
- 到底是什么？

09:30.137 --> 09:32.689
- IN A SPLIT SECOND,
BOTH MEN FIND THEMSELVES
- 刹那间，
两个人都找到了自己

09:32.793 --> 09:35.551
IN A FREEFALL...
both: [screaming]
自由落体...
两人：[尖叫]

09:35.655 --> 09:37.137
- THAT SENDS THEM SQUARELY
THROUGH THE ROOF
- 这让他们方形
穿过屋顶

09:37.241 --> 09:37.827
OF A VATS OF ACID FACTORY
酸厂大桶

09:37.931 --> 09:40.172
AND INTO A VAT OF ACID
并放入一桶酸中

09:40.275 --> 09:42.620
THAT IS TIPPED OVER
BY AN ERRANT ALIEN SPACESHIP,
翻倒了
通过一艘错误的外星飞船，

09:42.724 --> 09:44.758
CARRYING THE TWO BLINDLY
ON A WAVE OF ACID
盲目地背着两个人
酸潮中

09:44.862 --> 09:47.137
DURING A SOLAR ECLIPSE
ON A LEAP YEAR,
日食期间
在闰年，

09:47.241 --> 09:49.137
PRECARIOUSLY CAREENING
INTO A BOMB-TESTING SITE
危险的倾斜
进入炸弹测试现场

09:49.241 --> 09:52.827
WHERE A CATACLYSMIC EXPLOSION
EXPOSES OUR HEROES IN WAITING
发生灾难性爆炸的地方
暴露我们等待中的英雄

09:52.931 --> 09:55.655
TO HIGHLY TOXIC RADIUM GASES.
高毒性镭气体。

09:55.758 --> 09:57.068
THEN, AS FATE WOULD HAVE IT,
然后，正如命运所愿，

09:57.172 --> 10:00.068
MAGICAL STORM CLOUDS MOVE IN,
ZAPPING BOTH MEN
魔法风暴云袭来，
攻击两个人

10:00.172 --> 10:02.413
WITH A NEON PLAID
LIGHTNING BOLT
带有霓虹格子
闪电

10:02.517 --> 10:04.413
AND RAINING RADIOACTIVE OOZE,
和放射性软泥雨，

10:04.517 --> 10:07.620
WHICH, THROUGH CENTRIFUGAL FORCE
AND ELECTROMAGNETIC TURBULENCE,
通过离心力
和电磁湍流，

10:07.724 --> 10:09.758
CAUSES A POWERFUL EARTHQUAKE
DEEP IN THE JUNGLE
引发强烈地震
丛林深处

10:09.862 --> 10:11.965
2,000 MILES AWAY,
CONSEQUENTLY UNEARTHING
2,000 英里之外，
随之而来的发掘

10:12.068 --> 10:13.896
A MAGICAL CRYSTAL WITH WINGS
带翅膀的魔法水晶

10:14.000 --> 10:16.655
THAT FLIES TO ERNIE AND TIM'S
EXACT LOCATION
飞往厄尼和蒂姆家
确切位置

10:16.758 --> 10:19.310
AND, POWERED
BY SUPER GAMMA ENERGY CURRENTS,
并且，供电
通过超级伽玛能量流，

10:19.413 --> 10:23.586
PILOTS THEM TO OPEN SKIES
UNTIL, NOT PAYING ATTENTION,
引导他们进入开放的天空
直到不注意，

10:23.689 --> 10:26.172
THE CRYSTAL CLIPS THE TOP
OF A BILLBOARD,
水晶夹在顶部
广告牌的，

10:26.275 --> 10:29.965
FLINGING THE TWO BACK TO THEIR
APARTMENT MIRACULOUSLY UNHARMED,
将两人扔回各自的位置
公寓奇迹般地毫发无伤，

10:30.068 --> 10:32.275
WHEN...
[microwave beeps]
当...
[微波炉嘟嘟声]

10:32.379 --> 10:33.965
- HEY, THE POPCORN'S READY.
- 嘿，爆米花准备好了。

10:34.068 --> 10:36.965
- THEY PROCEED
WITH MOVIE NIGHT
- 他们继续
与电影之夜

10:37.068 --> 10:41.793
AND EAT
SLIGHTLY OVERCOOKED POPCORN.
并吃
爆米花稍微煮过头了。

10:41.896 --> 10:44.758
- MM. I THINK
YOU OVERCOOKED THIS A LITTLE.
- 毫米。我认为
你煮得太过头了一点。

10:44.862 --> 10:48.137
- SUDDENLY AN AMAZING REACTION
TO THE OVERCOOKED POPCORN
- 突然出现惊人的反应
到煮过头的爆米花

10:48.241 --> 10:50.931
HITS THEM WITH A JOLT
OF COSMIC SUPER ENERGY,
给他们带来震动
宇宙超级能量，

10:51.034 --> 10:53.655
METAMORPHOSIZING ERNIE
INTO AN INCREDIBLY STRONG,
变形厄尼
变成一个令人难以置信的强大，

10:53.758 --> 10:56.068
SEA STAR-WEARING SUPERHERO
佩戴海星的超级英雄

10:56.172 --> 10:59.482
AND TIM INTO A SLIGHTLY
LESS STRONG, BUT ALSO SUPER
和蒂姆稍微
不太强，但也超级

10:59.586 --> 11:01.551
SAILOR-LOOKING GUY.
水手模样的家伙。

11:01.655 --> 11:03.689
- I HAVE THE SUDDEN
AND INCREDIBLE URGE
- 我突然有
和令人难以置信的冲动

11:03.793 --> 11:06.000
TO BREATHE WATER
INSTEAD OF AIR.
呼吸水
代替空气。

11:06.103 --> 11:08.034
- AS DO I.
- 我也一样。

11:08.137 --> 11:12.206
- AND THAT IS HOW THEY BECAME
THE SUPERHEROES WE HAVE COME
- 这就是他们的样子
我们来了的超级英雄

11:12.310 --> 11:14.827
TO KNOW AS...
知道为...

11:16.586 --> 11:19.310
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY,
美人鱼和藤壶男孩，

11:19.413 --> 11:21.413
DEFENDERS OF THE DEEP.
深渊的捍卫者。

11:21.517 --> 11:24.827
[music winds down]
[音乐结束]

11:24.931 --> 11:29.586
- OH, FEELS JUST LIKE YESTERDAY,
DOESN'T IT, MERMAIDMAN?
- 哦，感觉就像昨天一样，
不是吗，美人鱼？

11:29.689 --> 11:31.068
- NO.
NOT REALLY.
- 不。
并不真地。

11:31.172 --> 11:34.655
- OH.
SO WHAT DO YOU BOYS THINK?
- 哦。
那么你们觉得怎么样？

11:34.758 --> 11:36.206
BOYS?
男孩们？

11:36.310 --> 11:38.068
- OKAY, PATRICK, THE OVERCOOKED
POPCORN WILL BE READY
- 好吧，帕特里克，煮过头了
爆米花就准备好了

11:38.172 --> 11:39.965
IN 12 MINUTES.
12 分钟后。

11:40.068 --> 11:42.551
- THIS IS GONNA BE
SO SUPER AWESOME.
- 这将会是
太棒了。

11:42.655 --> 11:44.379
- SO SUPERHERO AWESOME.
- 超级英雄太棒了。

11:44.482 --> 11:45.965
both: NO! STOP!
两人：不！停止！

11:46.068 --> 11:48.586
- BUT YOU'RE
NOT SUPERHERO MATERIAL.
- 但你是
不是超级英雄的材料。

11:48.689 --> 11:50.034
- LOOK AT THOSE SHOES...
- 看看那些鞋子......

11:52.551 --> 11:55.448
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

11:55.551 --> 12:00.551
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:07.620 --> 12:10.586
- THE KRUSTY KRAB IS STOWED
AND READY TO SLUMBER.
- 蟹壳蟹已收起
准备睡觉了。

12:10.689 --> 12:12.344
- GOOD JOB, LADDIE.
- 干得好，莱迪。

12:12.448 --> 12:14.965
ANOTHER FRUITFUL DAY
PUSHING PATTIES.
又是充实的一天
推肉饼。

12:15.068 --> 12:16.482
- PUSHING WHAT?
- 推什么？

12:16.586 --> 12:20.586
- YOU KNOW, TURNING PATTIES
INTO LETTUCE.
- 你知道，转动肉饼
变成生菜。

12:20.689 --> 12:21.793
- UM, I'M NOT FOLLOWING YOU.
- 嗯，我不跟着你。

12:21.896 --> 12:24.172
- CABBAGE.
GREENBACKS.
- 卷心菜。
美元。

12:24.275 --> 12:25.172
MONEY!
钱！

12:25.275 --> 12:26.793
- OH, YOU MEAN YOUR OBSESSION.
- 哦，你的意思是你的痴迷。

12:26.896 --> 12:29.551
- OBSESSION IS KIND
OF A STRONG WORD.
- 痴迷是一种善意
一个强有力的词。

12:32.000 --> 12:35.103
[lullaby plays]
[摇篮曲演奏]

12:35.206 --> 12:37.793
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:37.896 --> 12:41.482
SLEEP TIGHT,
MY LITTLE ANGELS.
睡个好觉，
我的小天使们。

13:00.793 --> 13:02.931
- 35 LEFT,
- 剩余 35 个，

13:03.034 --> 13:06.103
25 RIGHT,
25 对，

13:06.206 --> 13:08.896
AND FINALLY 4 LEFT.
最后还剩下 4 个。

13:09.000 --> 13:10.931
OPEN SAYS ME!
我说，开放！

13:11.034 --> 13:13.448
HEY, WHAT GIVES?
嘿，有什么？

13:13.551 --> 13:15.517
I WAS LOOKING
RIGHT AT THE COMBINATION.
我在找
就在组合处。

13:15.620 --> 13:16.655
WHY ISN'T IT OPENING?
为什么不开放？

13:16.758 --> 13:18.241
AAGH!
[screams]
啊啊！
[尖叫声]

13:18.344 --> 13:21.000
- WHAT'S GOING ON IN HERE?
- 这里发生了什么事？

13:21.103 --> 13:24.517
HMM.
EVERYTHING SEEMS TO BE IN ORDER.
唔。
一切似乎都井然有序。

13:24.620 --> 13:26.137
THE SAFE
IS STILL SAFE.
保险箱
仍然安全。

13:26.241 --> 13:28.448
HUH.
I MUST BE HEARING THINGS.
呵呵。
我一定是听到了什么声音。

13:28.551 --> 13:30.344
HEY, HOW'D THAT PICKLE
GET ON THE FLOOR?
嘿，那个泡菜怎么样？
上场吗？

13:30.448 --> 13:33.448
NOW WHAT WAS THAT RULE
ABOUT DROPPED FOOD?
现在那条规则是什么
关于掉落的食物？

13:33.551 --> 13:37.275
WAS IT FIVE SECONDS
OR FIVE MINUTES OR...
是五秒钟吗
或五分钟或...

13:37.379 --> 13:39.379
AH, WELL, WASTE NOT,
WANT NOT.
啊，好吧，不要浪费，
不想。

13:48.206 --> 13:49.758
- PLANKTON, WHERE HAVE YOU BEEN?
- 浮游生物，你去哪儿了？

13:49.862 --> 13:52.793
- TRUST ME,
YOU DO NOT WANT TO KNOW.
- 相信我，
你不想知道。

13:52.896 --> 13:55.000
- DID YOU GET
THE KRABBY PATTY FORMULA?
- 你得到了吗
蟹肉饼配方？

13:55.103 --> 13:56.586
LIKE I HAVE TO ASK.
就像我必须问的那样。

13:56.689 --> 13:59.344
- NO, AND I PROBABLY NEVER WILL.
- 不，我可能永远不会。

13:59.448 --> 14:02.586
- YOU NEED
A MORE POSITIVE OUTLOOK.
- 你需要
更积极的前景。

14:02.689 --> 14:04.275
- OH, KAREN.
- 哦，凯伦。

14:04.379 --> 14:07.000
IF YOU COULD JUST SEE THINGS
THE WAY I DO.
如果你能看到东西
我的方式。

14:09.068 --> 14:10.965
- PLANKTON!
- 浮游生物！

14:11.068 --> 14:13.206
- WHAT?
- I THINK YOU HIT IT.
- 什么？
- 我想你成功了。

14:13.310 --> 14:15.827
YOU COULDN'T SEE
THE CORRECT COMBINATION
你看不到
正确的组合

14:15.931 --> 14:17.965
BECAUSE YOU HAVE
ONLY ONE EYE.
因为你有
只有一只眼睛。

14:18.068 --> 14:20.000
YOU LACK DEPTH PERCEPTION.
你缺乏深度感知。

14:20.103 --> 14:21.413
- MAYBE YOU'RE RIGHT.
- 也许你是对的。

14:21.517 --> 14:25.310
THAT WOULD EXPLAIN
WHY I STINK AT DARTS.
这就可以解释了
为什么我玩飞镖很糟糕。

14:25.413 --> 14:27.482
- WHAT YOU NEED
IS A SECOND EYE.
- 您需要什么
是第二只眼睛。

14:27.586 --> 14:29.172
- KAREN, MY DEAR,
- 凯伦，亲爱的，

14:29.275 --> 14:31.344
I THINK YOU'RE ONTO SOMETHING.
我认为你有所作为。

14:31.448 --> 14:34.172
LOOKS LIKE IT'S TIME
FOR AN UPGRADE!
看来是时候了
升级！

14:36.724 --> 14:38.724
[machinery whirring]
[机器的呼呼声]

14:42.931 --> 14:44.655
SUCCESS!
成功！

14:44.758 --> 14:46.413
UH-OH.
THAT AIN'T GOOD.
呃-哦。
那不好。

14:46.517 --> 14:48.068
NO, NO, NO,
不，不，不，

14:48.172 --> 14:50.275
NO, NO,
NO, NO, NO, NO!
不，不，
不，不，不，不！

14:50.379 --> 14:55.000
I CAN SEE EVERY--
AAHH!
我可以看到每一个——
啊啊！

14:58.931 --> 15:00.931
BINOCULAR VISION,
HERE I COME.
双目视觉，
我来了。

15:01.034 --> 15:03.793
[beep]
[嘟]

15:05.000 --> 15:06.551
WHAT?
什么？

15:06.655 --> 15:08.103
OH, MAMA.
哦，妈妈。

15:08.206 --> 15:10.965
STOP.
I COMMAND YOU.
停止。
我命令你。

15:11.068 --> 15:13.517
OH, COME ON,
PLEASE STOP.
哦，来吧，
请停下来。

15:13.620 --> 15:15.758
[laser blasts]
[激光爆炸]

15:20.137 --> 15:22.448
NEXT.
下一个。

15:22.551 --> 15:26.206
KAREN, WHAT AM I DOING WRONG?
凯伦，我做错了什么？

15:26.310 --> 15:29.137
- YOUR EXPERIMENTS ARE MISSING
ONE ESSENTIAL INGREDIENT.
- 你的实验不见了
一种基本成分。

15:29.241 --> 15:30.965
- IT'S NOT LOVE, IS IT?
- 这不是爱，不是吗？

15:31.068 --> 15:32.413
BECAUSE YOU KNOW
I HATE THAT STUFF.
因为你知道
我讨厌那些东西。

15:32.517 --> 15:35.724
- NO, IT'S CELLS
FROM ANOTHER EYE.
- 不，是细胞
从另一只眼睛来看。

15:35.827 --> 15:38.517
EVEN A SINGLE TEARDROP
WOULD CONTAIN ENOUGH DNA.
即使是一滴泪珠
含有足够的 DNA。

15:38.620 --> 15:39.275
- TEARS, HUH?
- 泪水，嗯？

15:39.379 --> 15:42.758
I GUESS IF I HAVE TO.
我想我是否必须这样做。

15:42.862 --> 15:44.517
[screams]
[尖叫声]

15:44.620 --> 15:47.034
[sobs]
[抽泣]

15:47.137 --> 15:49.379
WILL THESE DO?
这些可以吗？

15:49.482 --> 15:50.758
- NO, SILLY.
- 不，傻瓜。

15:50.862 --> 15:54.482
THEY HAVE TO BE FROM SOMEONE
WHO ALREADY HAS TWO EYES.
它们必须来自某人
谁已经有两只眼睛了。

15:54.586 --> 15:55.758
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

15:55.862 --> 15:57.758
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:57.862 --> 15:59.241
TWO EYES, HUH?
两只眼睛，嗯？

15:59.344 --> 16:03.482
I THINK I KNOW A CRYBABY
WHO FITS THAT DESCRIPTION.
我想我认识一个爱哭鬼
谁符合该描述。

16:04.689 --> 16:06.275
- HI, PLANKTON.
- 嗨，浮游生物。

16:06.379 --> 16:10.310
- HEY, SPONGEBOB.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

16:10.413 --> 16:11.724
WANT TO HEAR A SAD STORY?
想听一个悲伤的故事吗？

16:11.827 --> 16:13.344
- NO.
NOT PARTICULARLY.
- 不。
不是特别。

16:13.448 --> 16:16.137
- ONCE UPON A TIME,
THERE WAS A YELLOW DOOFUS
- 从前，
有一个黄色的傻瓜

16:16.241 --> 16:17.862
WHO LOVED TO DRINK MILK
WITH HIS LUNCH.
谁喜欢喝牛奶
和他的午餐。

16:17.965 --> 16:20.172
UNFORTUNATELY FOR SAID DOOFUS,
不幸的是，对于所说的傻瓜来说，

16:20.275 --> 16:22.551
HIS MILK
WAS TRAGICALLY SPILT.
他的牛奶
惨遭泼溅。

16:22.655 --> 16:24.724
THE END.
结束。

16:24.827 --> 16:27.379
- S-S-SAD STORY.
- 悲伤的故事。

16:27.482 --> 16:28.586
[weeps]
[哭泣]

16:28.689 --> 16:30.793
AND SO TIMELY.
非常及时。

16:30.896 --> 16:32.862
[sobs]
[抽泣]

16:39.862 --> 16:41.206
- GET A GRIP.
- 抓紧时间。

16:41.310 --> 16:44.137
- I SUPPOSE HE'S RIGHT.
- 我想他是对的。

16:44.241 --> 16:46.586
GOOD THING I ALWAYS BRING
BACKUP MILK.
我总是带来的好东西
备用牛奶。

16:51.413 --> 16:53.448
- ARE YOU SURE YOU WANT
TO GO THROUGH WITH THIS?
- 你确定要吗
要完成这个吗？

16:53.551 --> 16:56.344
- YES. LET'S HURRY UP
AND GET IT OVER WITH.
- 是的。让我们快点
并把它结束。

17:03.241 --> 17:04.655
MOMMY!
妈妈！

17:04.758 --> 17:06.931
HERE COME THE PAIN!
痛苦来了！

17:07.034 --> 17:11.206
[moaning]
[呻吟]

17:13.068 --> 17:15.827
THAT WASN'T SO BAD.
UH-OH.
那还不错。
呃-哦。

17:15.931 --> 17:19.793
HERE WE GO.
开始了。

17:19.896 --> 17:22.103
EUREKA!
- SO DOES IT WORK?
发现了！
- 那么它有效吗？

17:22.206 --> 17:24.448
- YOU TELL ME.
- 你告诉我。

17:25.896 --> 17:26.551
BULL'S-EYE!
靶心！

17:26.655 --> 17:28.448
NOW FOR MY NEXT TARGET--
现在我的下一个目标——

17:28.551 --> 17:29.896
THE KRABBY PATTY SECRET FORMULA.
蟹肉饼的秘密配方。

17:33.137 --> 17:35.034
[laughs wickedly]
[邪恶地笑]

17:35.137 --> 17:36.068
WHAT?
什么？

17:36.172 --> 17:38.103
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

17:38.206 --> 17:41.413
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

17:41.517 --> 17:44.241
WHY DOES EVERYTHING
LOOK SO WEIR...
为什么一切都如此
看起来很奇怪...

17:44.344 --> 17:46.862
LOOK SO BEAUTIFUL?
看起来很漂亮吗？

17:46.965 --> 17:49.344
- ♪ LA LA LA LA LA
- ♪ 啦啦啦啦啦

17:49.448 --> 17:51.931
- HI, SPONGEBOB.
GREAT TO SEE YOU, BUDDY.
- 嗨，海绵宝宝。
很高兴见到你，伙计。

17:52.034 --> 17:53.275
- HI, PLANKTON.
WHAT YOU DOING?
- 嗨，浮游生物。
你在做什么？

17:53.379 --> 17:55.344
- I THOUGHT
I WAS GONNA STEAL SOMETHING,
- 我以为
我要偷东西，

17:55.448 --> 17:57.137
CAN'T IMAGINE WHY,
无法想象为什么，

17:57.241 --> 18:02.275
SO I'M JUST ENJOYING
THIS LOVELY DAY.
所以我只是享受
这美好的一天。

18:02.379 --> 18:04.896
- OKAY.
BUH-BYE.
- 好的。
再见。

18:10.448 --> 18:12.586
HONEY, I'M HOME.
亲爱的，我回来了。

18:12.689 --> 18:15.034
- OH, YOU'RE A HAPPY CAMPER.
- 哦，你是一个快乐的露营者。

18:15.137 --> 18:16.586
DID YOU FINALLY STEAL
THE FORMULA?
你终于偷了吗
公式？

18:16.689 --> 18:21.206
- FORMULA?
WHAT FORMULA?
- 公式？
什么公式？

18:21.310 --> 18:22.655
I FORGOT THE FORMULA.
我忘记了公式。

18:22.758 --> 18:25.448
I CAN'T IMAGINE
WHAT GOT INTO ME.
我无法想象
我怎么了？

18:25.551 --> 18:27.137
- IT'S THAT NEW EYE OF YOURS.
- 这就是你的新眼睛。

18:27.241 --> 18:29.448
YOUR EVIL DNA
HAS BECOME CORRUPTED
你的邪恶基因
已腐败

18:29.551 --> 18:31.586
BY SPONGEBOB'S NICE DNA.
源自海绵宝宝的美好 DNA。

18:31.689 --> 18:34.344
YOU'VE GONE FROM EVIL
TO NEEVIL!
你已经脱离了邪恶
致尼维尔！

18:34.448 --> 18:37.000
YOU'RE BECOMING AS HARMLESS
AS THAT FRY COOK.
你正在变得无害
就像那个炸菜一样。

18:37.103 --> 18:37.758
- NONSENSE.
-废话。

18:37.862 --> 18:40.034
YOU'RE IMAGINING THINGS.
你在想象事情。

18:40.137 --> 18:42.620
- REALLY?
LET'S TEST IT, SHALL WE?
- 真的吗？
让我们测试一下，好吗？

18:42.724 --> 18:45.137
- [grunts]
- TELL ME WHAT YOU SEE
- [咕哝]
- 告诉我你看到了什么

18:45.241 --> 18:46.793
IN THESE INK BLOTS.
在这些墨迹中。

18:46.896 --> 18:49.379
- HMM.
LOOKS LIKE...
- 唔。
看起来像……

18:49.482 --> 18:51.965
A PRETTY BUTTERFLY.
- NOPE. TRY AGAIN.
一只漂亮的蝴蝶。
- 没有。再试一次。

18:52.068 --> 18:53.965
WHAT DOES THIS REMIND YOU OF?
这让你想起什么？

18:54.068 --> 18:57.034
- AW, IT'S A LITTLE PUPPY DOGGY.
- 噢，这是一只小小狗。

18:57.137 --> 18:58.620
- [grunts]
TRY THIS.
- [咕哝]
试试这个。

18:58.724 --> 19:02.379
- UM...
- I'LL GIVE YOU A HINT.
- 嗯...
- 我会给你一个提示。

19:02.482 --> 19:04.000
[imitates explosion]
【模拟爆炸】

19:04.103 --> 19:06.275
- A BOUQUET OF FLOWERS?
- 一束鲜花？

19:06.379 --> 19:09.241
WOULD YOU LIKE
SOME FLOWERS, HONEY?
你愿意吗
一些花，亲爱的？

19:09.344 --> 19:11.689
- CELLS FROM THAT SPONGE
- 来自海绵的细胞

19:11.793 --> 19:13.310
HAVE CHANGED
YOUR WHOLE POINT OF VIEW.
已经改变
您的整体观点。

19:13.413 --> 19:16.137
- A FEW BLOBS OF INK
DOESN'T PROVE A THING.
- 几滴墨水
没有证明什么。

19:16.241 --> 19:18.344
I'M AS EVIL AS EVER.
我一如既往的邪恶。

19:18.448 --> 19:20.034
I'LL PROVE IT RIGHT NOW
BY STEALING
我现在就证明这一点
通过偷窃

19:20.137 --> 19:21.413
THE KRABBY PATTY
SECRET FORMULA.
蟹肉饼
秘密配方。

19:24.275 --> 19:27.827
- FIRE!
[overlapping shouting]
- 火！
[重叠的喊叫]

19:27.931 --> 19:28.620
IT'S BURNING!
它正在燃烧！

19:28.724 --> 19:31.551
- SUCH LOVELY DESTRUCTION.
- 如此可爱的破坏。

19:31.655 --> 19:35.724
- HELP! SAVE ME!
[slurps]
- 帮助！救救我！
[啜饮]

19:35.827 --> 19:37.931
SAVE ME!
救救我！

19:38.034 --> 19:40.206
- I'LL HELP YOU.
- 我会帮助你。

19:40.310 --> 19:41.379
DO NOT WORRY, CITIZEN.
别担心，公民。

19:41.482 --> 19:44.275
I'LL CATCH YOU.
我会抓住你的。

19:44.379 --> 19:47.103
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

19:47.206 --> 19:50.275
COMING DOWN.
即将下来。

19:50.379 --> 19:51.448
- OH, NO.
- 哦，不。

19:51.551 --> 19:54.241
- THANKS, BUDDY.
- 谢谢，伙计。

19:54.344 --> 19:57.724
[slurps]
[啜饮]

19:57.827 --> 19:59.551
- UNBELIEVABLE!
- 难以置信！

19:59.655 --> 20:01.586
I'VE COMMITTED
ANOTHER SELFLESS ACT.
我已承诺
又一个无私的行为。

20:01.689 --> 20:04.000
THIS EYE IS TAKING OVER.
这只眼睛正在接管。

20:04.103 --> 20:05.448
[grunts]
[咕哝]

20:05.551 --> 20:07.068
BUT I MUST STAY STRONG
但我必须保持坚强

20:07.172 --> 20:11.206
AND CONCENTRATE ON SWIPING
THE KRABBY PATTY FORMULA.
集中精力刷卡
蟹肉饼配方。

20:11.310 --> 20:12.379
WHAT'S THIS?
这是什么？

20:12.482 --> 20:14.758
IT'S THE KRABBY PATTY FORMULA.
这就是蟹肉饼配方。

20:14.862 --> 20:16.655
HUH! WHA--
KRABS MUST HAVE LOST IT!
哈！世界卫生大会--
螃蟹一定是丢了！

20:16.758 --> 20:19.482
- AND THAT'S WHY YOUR PROMOTION
- 这就是您晋升的原因

20:19.586 --> 20:21.793
MEANS A 50% CUT IN SALARY.
意味着减薪 50%。

20:21.896 --> 20:23.344
UNDERSTAND, SPONGEBOB?
明白了吗，海绵宝宝？

20:23.448 --> 20:24.827
- YES, SIR,
MR. KRABS.
- 是的，先生，
先生。螃蟹。

20:24.931 --> 20:26.275
- HEY, EUGENE.
- 嘿，尤金。

20:26.379 --> 20:28.034
YOU MISSING ANYTHING?
你还缺少什么吗？

20:28.137 --> 20:29.103
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

20:29.206 --> 20:30.413
ME KRABBY PATTY FORMULER!
我是蟹肉饼配方师！

20:30.517 --> 20:32.344
- THAT'S RIGHT, KRABS.
- 没错，蟹蟹。

20:32.448 --> 20:35.827
UNBELIEVABLY, I FOUND IT LYING
ON THE GROUND!
令人难以置信的是，我发现它在撒谎
在地面上！

20:35.931 --> 20:37.482
[laughs wickedly]
[邪恶地笑]

20:37.586 --> 20:40.034
SO I'M GIVING IT BACK TO YOU.
TAKE IT.
所以我把它还给你。
接受它。

20:40.137 --> 20:43.827
- HEY, SOMETHING SMELLS,
AND IT ISN'T ME LONG JOHNS.
- 嘿，有什么味道，
而且这不是我的长裤。

20:43.931 --> 20:46.275
LET'S SEE HERE.
YOU HAD THE FORMULER.
让我们看看这里。
您拥有配方师。

20:46.379 --> 20:47.413
WHY DIDN'T YOU RUN OFF WITH IT?
你为什么不带着它跑掉？

20:47.517 --> 20:49.379
- WHY DIDN'T I RUN OFF
WITH IT?
- 我为什么不逃跑
有了它？

20:49.482 --> 20:50.413
WHY DIDN'T I RUN OFF WITH IT?
我为什么不带着它逃跑呢？

20:50.517 --> 20:52.310
BECAUSE THAT WOULD BE STEALING.
因为那会是偷窃。

20:52.413 --> 20:55.137
- SINCE WHEN DO YOU CARE
ABOUT STEALING?
- 从什么时候开始你在乎
关于偷窃？

20:55.241 --> 20:56.620
- OH, IT'S THIS CURSED NEW EYE!
- 哦，这就是这个该死的新眼睛！

20:56.724 --> 20:59.344
I'VE GOT TO GET RID OF IT.
我必须摆脱它。

20:59.448 --> 21:03.862
MUST BECOME MONOCULAR AGAIN.
必须再次变成单眼。

21:03.965 --> 21:05.172
[laughs wickedly]
[邪恶地笑]

21:05.275 --> 21:07.000
I DID IT.
我做到了。

21:09.931 --> 21:11.241
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

21:11.344 --> 21:12.896
[howling]
[嚎叫]

21:13.000 --> 21:14.344
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

21:14.448 --> 21:15.689
[crash]
- HMM.
[崩溃]
- 嗯。

21:15.793 --> 21:17.793
YOU KNOW,
I DON'T THINK I TRUST
你知道，
我不认为我信任

21:17.896 --> 21:20.379
THIS NICE, POLITE,
PLEASANT PLANKTON.
这个好，有礼貌，
宜人的浮游生物。

21:20.482 --> 21:23.620
- MR. KRABS, I THINK
PLANKTON HAS REALLY CHANGED.
- 先生。螃蟹，我想
浮游生物确实发生了变化。

21:23.724 --> 21:25.620
HE JUST NEEDS
SOME ENCOURAGEMENT.
他只需要
一些鼓励。

21:25.724 --> 21:27.758
AND I KNOW
JUST HOW TO DO IT.
我知道
就是怎么做。

21:28.793 --> 21:30.586
- UH-HUH.
- 呃哈。

21:31.448 --> 21:33.137
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

21:33.241 --> 21:37.068
[groaning]
[呻吟]

21:38.620 --> 21:41.344
MY LIFE OF EVIL IS OVER.
我的邪恶生活结束了。

21:41.448 --> 21:42.724
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

21:42.827 --> 21:44.689
HEY.
WHY IS IT SO DARK IN HERE?
嘿。
为什么这里这么黑？

21:44.793 --> 21:48.275
all: SURPRISE!
所有人：惊喜！

21:48.379 --> 21:50.620
- AAGH!
THE CHUM BUCKET'S BEEN INVADED.
- 啊啊！
密友桶被入侵了。

21:50.724 --> 21:52.310
I'LL NEVER SURRENDER.
NEVER!
我永远不会投降。
绝不！

21:52.413 --> 21:54.379
- AW, THIS ISN'T AN INVASION.
- 哦，这不是入侵。

21:54.482 --> 21:56.827
WE'RE HERE TO SHOW YOU
HOW MUCH WE APPRECIATE
我们在这里向您展示
我们多么感激

21:56.931 --> 21:59.172
ALL THE GOOD DEEDS
YOU'VE DONE LATELY.
所有的善行
你最近已经完成了。

21:59.275 --> 22:01.620
WE CAME TO GIVE YOU
A GREAT BIG HUG.
我们来给你
一个大大的拥抱。

22:01.724 --> 22:03.068
- WHAT? NO.
NOT HUGS.
- 什么？不。
不是拥抱。

22:03.172 --> 22:04.275
NOT HUGS.
[screams]
不是拥抱。
[尖叫声]

22:04.379 --> 22:07.172
all: YAY!
所有人：耶！

22:10.275 --> 22:11.482
- IT'S GONE.
- 不见了。

22:11.586 --> 22:15.482
THAT DISGUSTINGLY GOOD EYE
IS FINALLY GONE.
那双令人作呕的好眼睛
终于消失了。

22:15.586 --> 22:17.517
I'M CURED!
我痊愈了！

22:17.620 --> 22:19.689
THANK YOU.
THANK YOU ALL!
谢谢。
谢谢大家！

22:19.793 --> 22:21.551
ESPECIALLY YOU,
SPONGEBOB.
特别是你，
海绵宝宝。

22:21.655 --> 22:23.551
- HEY.
GLAD I COULD HELP.
- 嘿。
很高兴我能帮忙。

22:23.655 --> 22:26.586
- YES, THANKS TO YOU,
I'M EVIL AGAIN.
- 是的，谢谢你，
我又邪恶了。

22:26.689 --> 22:28.896
AND AS A TOKEN
OF MY APPRECIATION,
作为代币
谨致谢意，

22:29.000 --> 22:31.689
I'LL GIVE YOU ALL
A ROUSING SENDOFF
我会给你一切
激动人心的送别

22:31.793 --> 22:36.586
WITH MY INFRARED SECURITY
ATTACK LASERS!
与我的红外安全
攻击激光！

22:36.689 --> 22:39.482
[lasers blasting]
[激光爆破]

22:39.586 --> 22:43.000
all: [shouting]
全体：[喊叫]

22:43.103 --> 22:44.862
- [laughs wickedly]
- [邪恶地笑]

22:44.965 --> 22:47.448
OH, WELL, DEPTH PERCEPTION'S
OVERRATED ANYWAY.
哦，好吧，深度感知
无论如何，都被高估了。

22:47.551 --> 22:49.620
[grunts]
[咕哝]

